{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/739b556033bb4595a5d37a9f40f75d4a.poster.avif?t=1756205984\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/739b556033bb4595a5d37a9f40f75d4a.webm?t=1756205984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/739b556033bb4595a5d37a9f40f75d4a.mp4?t=1756205984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VANRAN is a dark fantasy action RPG where a fallen human slave wields a sealed blade to spark rebellion. <br>Players walk a brutal path toward freedom in a world of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/b287840279823c20a015696a30a9b0a7.poster.avif?t=1756205984\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/b287840279823c20a015696a30a9b0a7.webm?t=1756205984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/b287840279823c20a015696a30a9b0a7.mp4?t=1756205984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed chain action movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap-filled map design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish, fast soulslike combat with parry &amp; dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grotesque bosses with unique attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic battles against colossal titans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by vengeance or salvation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor farming &amp; loot exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing dungeons with high-level enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden legacy of the fallen king</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/4e0962d97cf2a2533483b4175518b285.avif?t=1756205984\" width=1080 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the demons that stand in your way and absorb their souls to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/e5d48ef7edec6e165bcdff24ef74e7c0.avif?t=1756205984\" width=1080 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your newfound strength, challenge the boss monsters of the demon realm\u2014if you dare...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/cd21eb33790340d4b25392687e2a5aef.avif?t=1756205984\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story through immersive cutscenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/extras/74116c5c8b4fb8afc4c4f9daa2e14051.avif?t=1756205984\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulslike battles against colossal titans unlike anything you\u2019ve experienced before.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449370?t=1756205984","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449370/2b191b98b8